        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>矩阵笔记</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]}\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      background: #6d777b;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"FangSong\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      color: #232323;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to bottom,\n          #efeee7 0px,\n          #efeee7 20px,\n          #aeb9ba 21px,\n          #aeb9ba 22px,\n          #efeee7 23px,\n          #efeee7 24px\n        );\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.45);\n      transform: rotate(1.4deg);\n      transform-origin: top center;\n    }\n    .page:before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      left: 45px;\n      width: 1px;\n      background: rgba(195,122,112,.43);\n    }\n    .content {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 56px;\n      right: 16px;\n      top: 10px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 22px;\n      letter-spacing: .5px;\n      transform: rotate(-.35deg);\n    }\n    .line { height: 22px; white-space: nowrap; }\n    .indent { padding-left: 20px; }\n    .indent2 { padding-left: 40px; }\n    .section { margin-top: 4px; }\n    .eq { font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"KaiTi\", serif; }\n    .small { font-size: 14px; }\n    .star { font-size: 20px; margin-right: 7px; }\n    .row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      min-height: 22px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .row .left { width: 143px; }\n    .row .mid { width: 190px; }\n    .matrix-area {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 92px;\n      margin-top: -1px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .inverse {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 13px;\n      top: 2px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .a-star {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 176px;\n      top: 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .diag {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 398px;\n      top: 25px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .caption {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 132px;\n      top: 68px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .tiny-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 4px;\n      top: 70px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    mjx-container { margin: 0 !important; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\">4．两个 n 阶方阵乘积为单位矩阵，则两者互为逆矩阵</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent eq\">$|AB|=|A||B|$</div>\n\n      <div class=\"line section\">● 设 $A_1,A_2,\\cdots,A_m$ 都为 $n$ 阶方阵，则 $|A_1A_2\\cdots A_m|=|A_1|\\cdots|A_m|$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">推论：设 $A$ 为 $n$ 阶矩阵，则 $|kA|=k^n|A|$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2\">例：$A,B$ 都为 $n$ 阶矩阵，$|A|=a\\ne0$，求 $|B|$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2 eq\">$|AB|=|A||B|=a|B|=|-2E|=(-2)^n$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2 eq\">∴　$|B|=\\dfrac{(-2)^n}{a}$</div>\n\n      <div class=\"line section\">5．转置矩阵运算</div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <span class=\"left\"><span class=\"star\">☆</span>定理：$(A^T)^T=A$</span>\n        <span class=\"mid\">$(A+B)^T=A^T+B^T$</span>\n        <span>$|A|=|A^T|$</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <span class=\"left indent2\">$(kA)^T=kA^T$</span>\n        <span class=\"mid\">$(AB)^T=B^TA^T$</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"line\">　若 $A^T=A$，则 $A$ 为 对称矩阵　　若 $A^T=-A$，则 $A$ 为反对称矩阵</div>\n\n      <div class=\"line section\">6．逆矩阵　有$n$阶方阵$A,B$，使 $AB=E=BA$，则称$A$为可逆矩阵，$B$为$A$的逆矩阵</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">记作：$B=A^{-1}$，$A$ 的逆矩阵记为 $A^{-1}$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">性质一：$AB=E=BA,\\quad AC=E=CA$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2 eq\">$B=BE=B(AC)=(BA)C=EC=C$ <span style=\"margin-left:80px\">= 逆矩阵唯一</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"matrix-area\">\n        <div class=\"inverse\"><span class=\"star\">☆</span>$A^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{|A|}A^*$</div>\n        <div class=\"a-star\">\n          $A^*=\n          \\begin{bmatrix}\n          A_{11}&A_{21}&\\cdots&A_{n1}\\\\\n          A_{12}&A_{22}&\\cdots&A_{n2}\\\\\n          \\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\\n          A_{1n}&A_{2n}&\\cdots&A_{nn}\n          \\end{bmatrix}$\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"diag\">$AA^*=\n          \\begin{bmatrix}\n          c&0\\\\\n          0&d\n          \\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">伴随矩阵　每个元素是原矩阵元素的代数余子式转置</div>\n        <div class=\"tiny-note\">对角线，其余为0</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"star\">☆</span>$AA^*=|A|\\cdot E=A^*A$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2\">推论：$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{|A|}A^*\\right)A=E$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">　若 $|A|\\ne0$，则 $|A^*|\\ne0$　　　　　　　$|A^*|=|A|^{\\,n-1}$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">　$A$ 可逆 $\\Longleftrightarrow |A|\\ne0$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">性质：　$|A^{-1}|=\\dfrac{1}{|A|}$　　　　$(A^T)^{-1}=(A^{-1})^T$</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent2\">$|A^{-1}|=\\dfrac{1}{|A|}$　　　　$(kA)^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{k}A^{-1}$</div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
